flowchart TD
    POS[Issuer-supplied ReceiptPayload] --> Validate[Validate receipt data locally]
    WASM[Bundled receipt validator] --> Validate
    Validate -->|Invalid| Error[CheqiSDKError with all detected issues]
    Validate -->|Valid| Existing[Existing receipt issuance flow]
    Existing --> Matching[Resolve owner devices]
    Matching --> Encrypt[Encrypt receipt payload locally]
    Encrypt --> Submit[Submit encrypted receipt]
    Existing --> Download[Existing encrypted download fallback]
